FAIL testdata/bad/bad-name.yaml:1:7  PQ1002: the job name is "Nightly Report", which is not a name paceq accepts

>  1 | name: Nightly Report
             ^
   2 | steps:

   A name is lower case letters, digits, underscores and dashes, starts with a letter
   or a digit, and is at most 64 characters: ^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$

       name: nightly-report

   It has to survive being typed on a command line, used as a directory name and
   put in a URL, and a name that needs quoting in any of those gets typed wrong.

   paceq error PQ1002  for the full explanation
